					S::[0][sMeria][0] += S::[0][sMeria][1];
			        format(string,sizeof(string),"UPDATE gb_others SET sMeria0 = %d",S::[0][sMeria][0]);
					mysql_tquery(1, string, "", "");
				    SetPVarInt(i,"playerUsePaynSpray",0);
				}
			}
			else V::[GetPlayerVehicleID(i)][vHealth] = hpcar;
			if(car >= ataxils[0] && car <= ataxils[1]) {
				if(V::[car][vTaxiDriver] == i && D::[i][dTaxiKey] == car) {
                    if(D::[i][dArendTaxi] != 0) {
						D::[i][dArendTaxi] --;
						switch(D::[i][dArendTaxi]) {
							case 400: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 800: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 1200: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 1600: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 2000: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 2400: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 2800: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 3200: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 3600: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 4000: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 4400: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 4800: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 5200: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
							case 5600: JobValueNow(i, 10, 350,Player[i][uJob]);
						}
					}
                    else {
                        D::[i][dArendTaxi] = -1;
						SendClientMessage(i,C_GRAY,""gbInfo"Ваш контракт с таксопарком подошёл к концу, верните автомобиль на место!");
						SetPVarInt(i,"CountBackTaxi",MAX_COUNT_BACK_TAXI);
						SetPVarInt(i,"CheckpointBack",_:SetPlayerCheckpoint(i,1099.9902,-1242.7791,15.3823,5.0));
                    }
                }
			}
			if(car >= dalncars[0] && car <= dalncars[1]) {
				if(V::[car][vDalnDriver] == i && D::[i][dDalnKey] == car) {
                    if(D::[i][dArendDaln] != 0) D::[i][dArendDaln] --;
                    else {
                        D::[i][dArendDaln] = -1;
						SendClientMessage(i,C_GRAY,""gbInfo"Ваш контракт с транспортной компанией подошёл к концу, верните автомобиль на место!");
						SetPVarInt(i,"CountBackDaln",MAX_COUNT_BACK_DALN);
						SetPVarInt(i,"CheckpointBackDaln",_:SetPlayerCheckpoint(i,2209.2693,-2220.6868,14.1527,5.0));
                    }
                }
			}
    		new Float:ST[4], vehicleid;
    		vehicleid = GetPlayerVehicleID(i);
			GetVehicleVelocity(vehicleid,ST[0],ST[1],ST[2]);
			ST[3] = floatsqroot(floatpower(floatabs(ST[0]), 2.0) + floatpower(floatabs(ST[1]), 2.0) + floatpower(floatabs(ST[2]), 2.0)) * 179.28625;
			V::[vehicleid][vMile] += ST[3]/2000;
			format(string,sizeof(string),"%.1f MP",V::[vehicleid][vMile]);
			PlayerTextDrawSetString(i,Speed[4][i],string);
		}
		else {
			if(GetPVarInt(i, "NarkEffect") <= 0) SetPlayerDrunkLevel(i, 0);
		}
	}	
	
	new 
		Float: hp;
	
	for(new i; i != MAX_VEHICLES; i ++) 
	{
		if( !IsValidVehicle( i ) ) 
			continue;
		
    	GetVehicleHealth( i, hp );
    	GetVehicleParamsEx( i, eng, light, other1, other2, other3, other4, other5 );
		
		switch( GetVehicleModel( i ) )
		{
			case 528, 601 :
			{
				if( hp <= 950.0 )
				{
					setVehicleHealth( i, 1000.0 );
				}
			}
			
			default :
			{
				if(hp <= 400.0) 
				{
					setVehicleHealth( i, 400.0 );
					SetVehicleParamsEx( i, false, light, other1, other2, other3, other4, other5 );
				}
			}
		}
		

    	new value = floatround(V::[i][vMile]);
    	if(value == 50.0 * V::[i][vCountMile]) {

    	    if( IsBuyingCar( i ) ) 
			{
    	        if(Car::[ i ][cStatus][0] != 20)
				{
					Car::[ i ][cStatus][0] -= 5;
				}
				else 
				{
					GetVehicleParamsEx( i, eng, light, other1, other2, other3, other4, other5 );
					
					switch( random( 10 ) ) 
					{
						case 0 .. 4: {}
						case 5 .. 9: SetVehicleParamsEx(i,false,light,other1,other2,other3,other4,other5);
					}
				}
    	    }
    		V::[i][vCountMile] ++;
    	}
  
    	if(IsVelo(i))
		{
    		GetVehicleParamsEx(i,eng,light,other1,other2,other3,other4,other5);
    		SetVehicleParamsEx(i,true,light,other1,other2,other3,other4,other5);
    	}
    }
	for(new i; i != MAX_GATE; i ++) {
		if(gTime[i] + (10) < gettime() && gStatus[i] == true) {
		    switch(G::[i][gObject]) {
		        case 968: MoveDynamicObject(gID[i], G::[i][gP][0],G::[i][gP][1],G::[i][gP][2] - 0.05, 0.05, G::[i][gP][3],G::[i][gP][4],G::[i][gP][5]);
                case 19313: MoveDynamicObject(gID[i], G::[i][gP][0],G::[i][gP][1],G::[i][gP][2], 1.0, G::[i][gP][3],G::[i][gP][4],G::[i][gP][5]);
                case 19912: MoveDynamicObject(gID[i], G::[i][gP][0],G::[i][gP][1],G::[i][gP][2], 1.0, G::[i][gP][3],G::[i][gP][4],G::[i][gP][5]);
			}
		    gStatus[i] = false;
		}
	}
    format(string,sizeof(string),"%02d:%02d",hour,minuts);
    TextDrawSetString(phoneOne[16],string);
    TextDrawSetString(phoneTwo[13],string);
    TextDrawSetString(phoneThree[5],string);
	return 1;
}


stock SetPlayerToFacePlayer(playerid, targetid) {
    new Float:pX, Float:pY, Float:pZ, Float:X, Float:Y, Float:Z,Float:ang;
    if(!IsPlayerConnected(playerid) || !IsPlayerConnected(targetid)) return 0;
    GetPlayerPos(targetid, X, Y, Z);
    GetPlayerPos(playerid, pX, pY, pZ);
    if( Y > pY ) ang = (-acos((X - pX) / floatsqroot((X - pX)*(X - pX) + (Y - pY)*(Y - pY))) - 90.0);
    else if( Y < pY && X < pX ) ang = (acos((X - pX) / floatsqroot((X - pX)*(X - pX) + (Y - pY)*(Y - pY))) - 450.0);
    else if( Y < pY ) ang = (acos((X - pX) / floatsqroot((X - pX)*(X - pX) + (Y - pY)*(Y - pY))) - 90.0);
    if(X > pX) ang = (floatabs(floatabs(ang) + 180.0));
    else ang = (floatabs(ang) - 180.0);
    SetPlayerFacingAngle(playerid, ang);
    return 0;
}

stock SuspectPlayer(playerid,text[],name[],value) {
	clear_massive();
	format( gb_string,sizeof( gb_string ),"%s объявил(-а) вас в розыск. Причина: %s.",name,text);
	SendClientMessage(playerid,C_LIGHTRED, gb_string);
	Player[playerid][uSuspect] += value;
	if(Player[playerid][uSuspect] >= 6) Player[playerid][uSuspect] = 6;
	SetPlayerWantedLevel(playerid,Player[playerid][uSuspect]);
	nowUpdateInfo(playerid , "d" , "gb_users" , "uName" , "uSuspect" , Player[playerid][uSuspect]);
	return 1;
}

nowUpdateInfo ( playerid , const type [ ] , db_table [ ] , db_name_field [ ] , field [ ] , {Float, _}:...) {
    static const STATIC_ARGS = 0x5 ;
	clear_massive();
    for ( new i , x = numargs ( ) - STATIC_ARGS ; i != x ; i++ ) {
        switch ( type [ i ] ) {
            case 'i','d' : format ( query , sizeof query , "update `%s` set `%s`=%d where BINARY `%s`='%s' limit 1;" , db_table , field , getarg (i + STATIC_ARGS ) , db_name_field , Player[playerid][uName] );
            case 'f' : format ( query , sizeof query , "update `%s` set `%s`=%f where BINARY `%s`='%s' limit 1;" , db_table , field , Float:getarg ( i + STATIC_ARGS ) , db_name_field , Player[playerid][uName] );
            case 's' : {
                for ( new a ; getarg ( i + STATIC_ARGS , a ) != 0x0 ; a++) {
                    gb_string [ a ] = getarg ( i+STATIC_ARGS , a ) ;
                }
                format ( query , sizeof query , "update `%s` set `%s`='%s' where BINARY `%s`='%s' limit 1;" , db_table , field , gb_string , db_name_field , Player[playerid][uName] ) ;
            }
        }
    }
    return mysql_tquery ( mysql, query, "", "" ) ;
}

stock SpeedVehicle(vehicleid) {
    new Float:x, Float:y, Float:z;
    GetVehicleVelocity(vehicleid, x, y, z);
    return floatround(floatsqroot(x*x+y*y)*100);
}

stock MeAction( playerid, text[], type ) 
{
	switch(type) 
	{
	    case 0: 
		{
			format:vb_string( "%s %s", GetCharacterName( playerid ), text );
			sendLongMessage( playerid, vb_string, 0xC2A2DAFF, 0xC2A2DAFF, 0xC2A2DAFF, 0xC2A2DAFF, 0xC2A2DAFF);
        }
        case 1: 
		{
			SetPlayerChatBubble( playerid, text, 0xC2A2DAFF, 15.0, 5000 );
        }
	}
	return 1;
}

stock DoAction( playerid, text[] ) 
{
	format:gb_string( "%s (( %s ))", text, GetCharacterName( playerid ) );
    sendLongMessage( playerid, gb_string, 0xC2A2DAFF, 0xC2A2DAFF, 0xC2A2DAFF, 0xC2A2DAFF, 0xC2A2DAFF );
	return 1;
}

stock GiveTaxiMoney(playerid) {
